  "links": [],
  "notes": [
   "Two instances are combined, so the model is in_memory; the conformed key across stores is SHIPMENT_ID (shipments) = shipment_id (delivery performance and freight invoice).",
   "SHIPMENTS is treated as the shipment-grain parent; the two Neon tables are assumed one row per shipment, so verify grain to avoid double counting.",
   "Entity counts (shipment count, customer count) should be added in Studio, not as base metrics.",
   "No existing Mosaic model clearly matches, so no links were added."
  ]
 },
